  "pli-tv-bi-vb-pc46:1.1": "Tena samayena buddho bhagavā Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati Jetavane Anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-pc46:1.2": "tena kho pana samayena Thullanandā bhikkhunī naṭānam pi . . . (XXVIII.1. Instead of samaṇacīvaraṃ deti [dassati] read sahatthā khādaniyaṃ bhojaniyaṃ deti ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-pc46:1.3": "",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-pc46:1.4": "",
